1.1.2 — 2026-08-14
  Cache-bust static CSS as well as JS so upgraded styles take effect.
  Shell input autofocuses and accepts typing without a click.
  Block cursor replaces the native caret and tracks the insertion point.

1.1.1 — 2026-08-14
  Fix recursion crash when an upgraded page loaded a cached matrix.js.
  Safe Mode rain now restarts when switching back to Matrix mode.

1.1.0 — 2026-08-14
  Safe Mode theme toggle: static, high-contrast UI honoring system dark mode.
  Light-palette plot set for Safe Mode on light-color-scheme systems.
  Interactive weather shell in the title bar with pipes, virtual filesystem,
  and easter eggs (including rm -rf /).
  shell-data.json export for shell history commands.
  New [Extras] options: enable_shell, default_theme, shell_history_days.
  Static assets now copy_always so upgrades pick up CSS/JS changes.

1.0.0 — 2026-08-14
  Initial release.
  - Live dashboard with phosphor-green terminal styling and digital rain.
  - History browser with Day/Week/Month/Year plots and statistics table.
  - Deep archive with per-month and per-year generated pages.
  - Extended sensor support (UV, radiation, air quality, lightning) with
    graceful degradation when data is absent.
  - Self-hosted Share Tech Mono and VT323 fonts (SIL Open Font License).
